<title>USA: Delta sees $60 mln restructuring charge.</title>
<headline>Delta sees $60 mln restructuring charge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines Inc said it expects to post a one-time charge of up to $60 million in the March quarter due to the restructuring of its European routes.</p>
<p>The Atlanta-based airline said the route overhaul is expected to improve the company's operating income by $62 million a year.</p>
</text>
